Z||000000||onfire||11-07-2000||03:40 AM||||Felt kinda left out everyone meeting all thes famous people. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Seriously though I met Jimmy Hoffa jr. a few yrs. ago, when he was running to be the president of the IBT (International Brotherhood of Teamsters). He came down and talked to all of us at work. <P>------------------<BR>"I know a little bit about everything, and alot about nothing"<BR><A HREF="http://homestead.deja.com/user.on_fire/on_fire.html" TARGET=_blank>Check out my little waist of banbwidth.</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever2||11-07-2000||07:20 PM||||Okay.  That's cool.<BR>When I was a kid I was on a swing and there was this guy with his grandaughter on the swing next to me, and we exchanged greetings.  Next day I saw in the paper that Sky King was in town, and there was his picture - the guy I was talking to!  I even watched & loved that show, but you know how people look different in person.<BR>||||reg||1
