Z||000010||Cheever2||11-08-2000||10:58 PM||||When I was a baby we lived next door to Gaylord Sartain, who was the Big Bopper on the Buddy Holly Story.  My older brother played with him, and his dad & mine were firemen.  He and Gary Busey had the funniest TV show I've ever seen, a weekly late night local show in Tulsa called the Uncanny Film Festival.  Sure wish we had VCR's back then.<BR> ||||reg||1
